Z||000012||Rare87GT||10-30-2001||01:22 AM||||Yeah, the only reason I made the username Rare87GT is because I thought it was pretty odd to find a Canadian car in my home town of Kansas and above all it be a Fiero as well.  That is the only reason I came up with that name.  I know there are probably tons of them in Canada, but to find one at a small dealership and nonetheless in Wichita, KS, it was pretty rare.  Anyways, thanks for all your comments.  Later.<P>------------------<BR>1987 GT||||reg||1
